<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices, as well as total net asset sizes as of July 22.</p>
<p>				  July 22/July 21  July 22/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.02		 8.16</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 6.54</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.12		13.14</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.04		52.20</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			   -2.82		37.03</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -2.97		37.58</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.42		17.43</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.07		33.35</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			   -2.76		46.48</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds -2.95		45.09</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.23		30.95</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.06		97.19</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991.</p>
